# Phase-C detection cache (regenerated by extract_detections) — all bags, both sites.
# Verified regenerable: re-running extract_detections.py --bag part2 reproduces the
# committed cache byte-identically (md5 15526f7e…, 42,517 detections, 3 seeds).
vineyard_nav/results/geometric/*/cache/*
!vineyard_nav/results/geometric/*/cache/.gitkeep
vineyard_nav/results/riseholme/*/cache/*
!vineyard_nav/results/riseholme/*/cache/.gitkeep

# ============================================
# Analysis outputs (regenerated from scripts)
# ============================================
vineyard_nav/analysis/output/

# ============================================
# Split manifests ARE tracked (small JSON, essential for reproducibility)
# ============================================
!vineyard_nav/data/splits/

